@BddTesting_HostAddress = http://localhost:5145

### 1. Get All Accounts
GET {{BddTesting_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Account By Number (Alice)
GET {{BddTesting_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/ACC-1001
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create New Account
POST {{BddTesting_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC-2001",
  "accountHolder": "David Miller",
  "initialDeposit": 750.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 4. Transfer Money (Alice -> Bob: $200.00)
POST {{BddTesting_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-1001",
  "toAccount": "ACC-1002",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "note": "Payment for shared dinner"
}
